title: "Numerisect: Multi-Engine Integer Factorization and Prime Analysis"
type: software
abstract: >-
  Numerisect is a local computational number-theory workstation that orchestrates
  optimized native engines for integer factorization, primality, prime analysis,
  algebraic exploration, and rigorous FLINT/Arb zeta computation.
